  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if we could change the Avatar a specific Look is already using.  I usually update my avatar on separate Blueprint IDs so I can keep old versions of my Avatar.  If I wanted to keep/migrate my current Look I would need to completely remake my Look from scratch for the new Avatar ID completely\n\nAdding the ability to easily switch out the Avatar a Look is using would solve this!\n\nIdeas on possible solutions:\n\n- A button in the Looks Editor to migrate all the accessories to the current equipped avatar.\n\n- An \"Export Look\" could be used and shared similar to how UI themes could be shared with an easily editable string.",
